  "slug": "jambonz-skills",
  "name": "Jambonz Skills",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "Skills for building voice applications on jambonz, the open-source CPaaS — voice AI agents, IVR menus, call routing, and MCP server setup.",
  "longDescription": "Ships **4 skills**.\n\n- **Skills** (4): `jambonz` (Build voice applications on jambonz, a voice AI orchestration platform and CPaaS), `jambonz-recipes` (Implementation recipes for jambonz voice app features), `jambonz-setup-mcp` (Set up the jambonz MCP server in AI coding tools), `jambonz-starters` (Ready-to-run jambonz starter applications)\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install jambonz-skills@claude-community` from `jambonz/skills`.",
